    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2100,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "# Roofing Weather + Crew Scheduling Agent\nNative nodes only: Schedule, Google Calendar, OpenWeatherMap, OpenAI, Telegram.\n\nHuman control:\n`/pause` - stop automatic checks\n`/resume` - restart\n`/status` - see state\n\nThe agent NEVER auto-moves customer appointments.\nWeather risk / low confidence / errors go to human review.\n\nConnect credentials:\n- Google Calendar\n- OpenWeatherMap\n- OpenAI\n- Telegram\n\nEdit `Business Config` with admin chat ID, crew chat ID and city."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
